WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:09.280
Oriku and the others captured two of the Shichi School's elders, Kain and Muhika, in order to expose its evil ways.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:17.500
However, Kain stated that once someone is deceived, it is impossible to make them think otherwise.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.360
So Oriku devised a plan.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.620
And set up a new sect.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:30.240
It's name, Kuushuu Wide Intelligence Tax Administration Bureau.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.980
*Subbed by JellySubs*

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.980
*Thanks for the help Jayden*

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.420
Is he the real deal?

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.020
Is he the real enlightened-sama?

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.760
He better not be another fraud.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.000
How could you say that?

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:24.120
Founder, why have you come to such a remote place?

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:29.160
This Oji Village will be the perfect place due to it's feng shui*.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:29.160
*Feng shui: Chinese system of geomancy believed to use the laws of both Heaven and Earth to help one improve life by receiving positive qi.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.520
I've decided to build my own "houdan" here.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.680
Oh! Here?!

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:38.040
So this is the place you were looking for?

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.700
What's a "houdan"?

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.600
Isn't it a place that's blessed?

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:46.520
However, my time in the mortal world is quickly coming to an end.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:52.960
I will return once again, but until then, Kain, please make the preparations.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.600
Yes sir!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:58.280
He vanished!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.440
As you'd expect from the founder.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.240
He took flight in the blink of an eye.

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:10.860
Once the founder has gone back up to the celestial sphere it takes awhile until he can come back down again.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:18.820
I'm sure it was thanks to your good luck that you met the founder today.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:22.520
Excuse me... what did he mean by building a "houdan"?

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:24.940
What could he have meant by that?

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:29.240
Hmm, it would be best if we spoke somewhere quiet.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:33.260
Well then, please give me some time to prepare the dining area.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:36.100
Much appreciated.

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:42.580
For how many years have you been training, warrior-sama?

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.620
Around 150 years?

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.520
That long?!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.640
Your acting was actually pretty good...

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.940
You on the other hand were awful.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:54.260
It was mostly all monotone, you have to put in more emotion.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.260
Mind your own business.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:59.280
Buho, you can come out now.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.120
I really thought I was gonna get roasted!

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:16.420
Please eat this, it's corn harvested from our field.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.860
I also brought a lot of eggplant.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.560
My mom told me to bring this.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.700
I brought this.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.600
More enlightened came to our village.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.900
We're so fortunate.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.140
You're strong aren't you.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:32.360
You're a gifted learner aren't you.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.560
By the way, the conversation we had before...

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:40.220
The reiki here is very rich and perfect for training.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:44.760
That's probably why the Shichi School wanted to keep this village under it's thumb.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:51.160
What was the "houdan" that the founder was talking about earlier?

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:58.940
He decided to gather all the reiki that is dotted around this land into one spot and turn it into magical stones.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.760
Will this village become rich then?

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:02.760
Indeed.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.480
M-mayor!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.920
Y-yeah...

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:12.940
However, building a "houdan" could also have an effect on this village's feng shui.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.720
So we have to have ask your forgiveness.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.980
You are this Village's benefactors.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.020
If there is anything we can help with, please let us know.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.020
Right Mayor?

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:27.980
Please! Please build a "houdan" here.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.980
Please try one of these.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.880
Are you serious about creating a "houdan"?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.520
Of course.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.900
Don't underestimate the Reiken mountain's study expert.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.900
It's all ready.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.900
Fundamental Knowledge of the "houdan"

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:48.420
Don't tell me you're gonna start studying this now are you?

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.800
Of course not.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.200
I've already finished studying it.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.200
This is just for consultation.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:00.380
I've got to memorize the characteristic geological features, decide on the type of "houdan" to create,

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:04.880
analyze the necessary steps and gather the necessary materials.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:12.340
Guys, could you do the shopping for me? I'll give you 2 days to gather all the ingredients that I've written on there.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:13.400
This is...

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:18.180
Seven sacks of pure gold, four sacks of unprocessed bronze, six sacks of "ruriipi"...

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:21.460
It doesn't matter how much we haggle, this will cost over 100 magical stones.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.900
What? Do you guys not have enough for that?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:30.040
Didn't you say that you made hundreds of thousands in profits from conning this one village?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:37.000
Those hundreds of thousands were earned by the School as a whole, it wasn't our individual income.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:42.600
Plus, there were also the various training expenses. We have no such savings.

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:45.360
Hmm, so you're poor huh.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:48.580
Alright then, I'll pay for it.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.280
Magical stones of the finest quality!

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:59.760
This also includes the errand charge right?

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:04.400
After we're done shopping let's drink enough sake we can drown in it.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.500
I'm so full!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.020
Please don't worry about a thing!

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:14.920
We'll start the preparations immediately.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:19.640
Where did you bring those magical stones from?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.120
They got given to everyone when we came down the mountain.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.780
You'll pay me my allowance later too, won't you?

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:27.820
This rice dish is really good!

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:28.960
Really?

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.520
Afterwards could you help them out with the shopping too?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.540
Hey!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:18.360
The holy woman and her warriors have already returned.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.360
Oh?

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:22.060
This is Bunho.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:25.760
Excuse me but, is this person also a warrior?

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:28.960
He's an underling that's just started training two years ago.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:33.000
We'll now start making the foundation bricks for the "houdan".

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.360
Give us a hand.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.140
It's here then.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.180
As soon as the bricks are baked get them to bring them here.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.700
Understood.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:34.820
One more thing.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:36.120
Yes?

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:38.060
Whose house is that?

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:42.320
Ah, that's my residence...

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.320
It's right in the reiki's path.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.140
Please take it down soon.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.120
What!?

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:50.240
Also, cut all the vegetation in this area.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:51.580
And by the end of today please.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:53.080
But, that's...

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.080
Ok then, let's move on.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.160
Wait a second!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.700
Mayor, this is for the village's sake.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.160
For the village's sake the establishment of the "houdan" has to be priority number one.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.180
Please don't do anything to mess it up, ok.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.180
But...

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.180
Let's go onto the next one.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.620
Again.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.760
Do you know where he is?

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.100
More or less.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:16.640
At dusk he was at the river by that big boulder.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:17.860
Ok.

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.880
These are some provisions from the villagers.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.580
They're just leftovers though.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.560
He's supposed to be the founder of the sect, so he can't really stay here can he...

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.980
Yeah...

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:29.640
Please tell him not to work himself too hard.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.400
Is he feeling rundown?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:44.080
In order to create a "houdan" you have to be able to control the reiki very expertly and be in a tide like state.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:48.640
He might be special, but he's only started training 2 years ago.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.040
This is not something that can be done at a moment's notice.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:54.580
Well, if he can't do it, then we can just make them wait until he can.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.720
That's all there is to it.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:59.180
What are you doing?

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.800
Don't just walk out during training!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.180
Training?

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:05.280
Yup, we're training.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.340
Ok ok, I'm on my way.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.780
Rei, how did you know where I was?

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:18.540
I can at least tell from the smell where my student is.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:21.200
As you'd expect from the woman in whom the Kyuubi resides.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:21.200
Kyuubi: Nine-tailed fox

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.200
I actually just heard it from Kain.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.020
Here, some provisions.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:30.180
The villagers bring us various things.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:36.460
Your training this time requires you to break ties with your family and friends, doesn't it?

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.740
I still can't think of such a thing.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.020
I know right.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:43.080
Even if that moment comes I don't think it will click.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.820
If I become a Chikuki I'll live 200 years.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.720
300 years if I become a Kyotan.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:51.440
And if I reach Kintan my life expectancy will be 500 years.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.100
You'll probably live even longer than that.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:57.840
I'd like at least one person to keep me company.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:01.180
Ok, I'll do my best.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.020
Good.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.820
Is it not going well?

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:06.940
What is?

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:11.780
Kain said that you were struggling. That seems unusual for you.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.780
He was watching huh?

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.340
It feels like I'm making a wooden beam on a potter's wheel.

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:23.420
As soon as there's a distraction and I try to compensate for it it all falls apart.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:28.960
I have to create a completely harmonic vortex of reiki.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.640
I see.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:34.060
Then we really have to demolish that house, don't we.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:34.780
Huh?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.520
The Mayor's house is in the path of the reiki flow.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:45.260
The villagers are begging him to demolish it, but the Mayor is being very resistant.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.260
That's unfortunate.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.740
I feel bad about getting in the way of your training, so I'll head back now.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:56.660
Oh yeah, what's your childhood friend's name again?

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.000
Otora?

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.800
Looks like he left the village.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.580
I don't really care...

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.580
I see, well then, good luck with your training.

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:09.060
Yeah, I really don't care about such a thing.

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:36.420
Mayor, please give in already.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:41.380
You're the one that's always saying that we should put aside our self-interests for the benefit of the village.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.180
Exactly!

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:49.280
I did. I did say that, but this is our house, my family is here,

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.540
if you take it down we won't have anywhere to live.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.480
You even asked Ofuki to pitch in some money.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.420
Are you telling us that you make others contribute but you don't do anything?

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.060
Yeah!!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.340
Plus, your relatives have a huge house, don't they.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.280
Just get them to let you stay there.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.920
Please don't do this!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:21.400
Many generations of my ancestors have lived in this house, mine included.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:26.620
Please! Don't take my house away from me!

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:31.400
Even if you refuse we're still destroying this house, by force if necessary.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.700
You can't...

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:36.480
Just do it, break it down!

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:38.920
Get out of the way.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.120
Stop this!

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:51.520
Whether he cooperates or not is something for him to decide, not something that should be forced!

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.100
Ofuki...

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.400
It's Fuki.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:59.360
I'm sure everyone here has something that they can't give up on.

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:08.540
Even if you demolish this house, without his approval I don't think the reiki passing through here will be good reiki for the 'houdan".

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:21.800
In order to build up a tranquility of mind I have to wrap the air around me, while devoid of distractive thoughts,

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:27.040
as if I'm being engulfed, and then.. become one with it.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.580
Impressive.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:32.520
But I can't do that.

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:35.020
You shouldn't worry about it so much.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.980
Everyone has their own growth period.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:46.380
I also had this close friend that started training more or less at the same time as me.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:49.760
At the beginning I was far better than him.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:54.440
But then all of a sudden he started making progress.

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:56.160
Did he overtake you?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.620
Yup...

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:03.440
But you see, there are many twists and turns when living a long life.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:07.980
When you least expect, you're back on equal footing again.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.480
Where is your friend now?

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:17.140
We were inseparable and joined the Shi School, but now look at me.

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:23.380
I bet... he's super angry with me.

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:28.540
Alright then, shall we head back?

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:32.800
All we can do here is be jealous.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.640
See, I told you.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:10.920
If the founder says he won't go through with it there's nothing we can do.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.640
Founder, the truth is...

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.640
It's my fault.

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:24.820
Please stand back, everyone.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:45.660
There are a few "houdan" individuals in the Reiken sect.

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:49.440
And the majority of them were called "houdan" craft prodigies.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:52.120
There's the "houdan" that elder Rikuri created.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:57.740
It's said that he completed his first "houdan" when he was a Kyotan.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:06.620
Oriku's strength as an enlightened cannot be compared with the elder's strength at that time.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.360
But his will...

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:15.120
There's a small chance that Oriku might succeed.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.500
Wow, it's considerably faster than the last time I saw it.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.500
And it's flowing perfectly.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.240
It's a stable vortex of reiki!

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:06.160
I can do this.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.440
It's all going according to plan.

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.300
So there's the problem. Just as I thought.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.820
My house!

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:25.580
I have to focus the reiki in the center.

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:31.700
I can't control it!

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.800
Get down!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.500
You!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.760
The meteor shard!

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.440
What just happened?

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:26.360
Did that meteor shard suppress the chaotic reiki?

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:33.900
This "houdan" contains the origins of the cosmos from when heaven and earth came to be.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:36.200
Chaos and mystery.

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:39.000
I name it "A Million Chaos Ball".

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.500
This village will finally become wealthy now.

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:52.940
The "A Million Chaos Ball" creates high quality magical stones from just absorbing a small amount of reiki.

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:57.300
Among them there were also coal looking fragments.

00:21:57.300 --> 00:22:03.940
They were, however, able to exchange 5 of these for more than a thousand normal magical stones, despite the undesirable byproduct.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:12.960
Due to the event that transpired here, the isthmus had established an economic foundation that would lead to a dramatic development later on.
